{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根大通：罗技国际业务与季度数据观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">罗技国际在截至6月底的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>财年第<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>交出了一份超出预期的成绩单。营收同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12.27亿美元</span>，高于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>和市场的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12.02亿</span>与<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12.00亿美元</span>预期；剔除6100万美元关税退款后，毛利率仍达44.8%，同样高于两家机构的43.5%和43.3%预测。但这份业绩的亮点被一个突发事件盖过：6月末，罗技一家半导体组件供应商的晶圆厂临时关闭，直接影响Gaming和Personal Workspace两大产品线的供货能力。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>在最新报告中更新公司观点。报告认为，需求端趋势仍然健康，问题集中在供给端。管理层将供应商事件的影响规模估计为第二财季<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2000万</span>美元、第三财季<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2亿美元</span>，并预计第四财季基本消化。换言之，这是一次有时间表的供给冲击，而非需求转弱。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVyMN5oJPBHibpQ9krhEGkwvib8BE5vaV6SiaOicMFH2dD2x3YcATDgrYBo9iaibzDeQlN5I9T8sQG9trbXDXetDTJMkiau0nWXZsznJo/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">研究主题与行业变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">分产品看，Pointing Devices同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>，Gaming增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>，Video Collaboration增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>。分地区看，美洲增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.16亿美元</span>，亚太增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.68亿美元</span>，EMEA则下滑1%至3.44亿美元。报告特别指出，北美市场已回到中个位数增长区间，Gaming品类在高端产品上表现广泛强劲，而Video Collaboration受益于企业客户持续投入会议室基础设施。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">各地区的市场份额增长都较为普遍，这强化了报告的一个判断：当前约束来自供给而非需求。如果需求本身<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">疲软</span>，不太可能出现全线份额<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">KC评论</span>：</strong> <span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>毛利率的构成。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">44.8%</span>的毛利率里，欧元走弱贡献约240-250个基点，ASP提升和产品成本下降各贡献约100个基点，但促销投入增加部分抵消了这些利好。剔除关税退款后，经营利润率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18.7%</span>仍高于两家机构的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17.0%</span>预期，说明主业盈利能力本身不差。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWep9vg9DaVaH5N4oMflnDcMiaYmr8rbWoEPvpriaFxojibQJzfdicf3HafOeNSc9HBPuNL14XuuBCj1VWyYg1vCe0lArroOOaIjtA/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 供应商晶圆厂关闭带来<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2000万</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2亿美元</span>的两季影响</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告将供应商事件定性为近期最值得关注的变量。管理层给出的影响路径是：第二财季<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2000万</span>美元、第三财季<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2亿美元</span>，第四财季基本解决。第二财季收入指引为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11.85亿</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12.20亿美元</span>，低于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12.50亿</span>和市场共识的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12.30亿</span>，其中已包含供应商事件的2000万美元逆风。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">经营利润指引为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.85亿</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.10亿美元</span>，对应约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16.4%</span>的经营利润率，低于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17.8%</span>和市场共识的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17.5%</span>。报告认为，读者会重点关注供给影响在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二三季度</span>的实际幅度，以及供应链恢复的可见度。这一不确定性叠加在宏观环境、消费支出韧性和企业外设配套率可持续性的既有疑问之上。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVUoyITJic1kkFn1epIRFiaEzLhrtibFJtcQyib8lZHaA2r1PdKAyCybMJAAjIQLq7lETDZz8GGktP2rqTslm2ZHhzZZlWQia3NCgKA/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. 全年经营利润率仍靠近<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18%</span>区间上沿</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">尽管近季有供给扰动，管理层对全年经营利润率的指引没有改变：仍预计落在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18%</span>长期目标区间的高端。支撑这一判断的，是健康的经营表现加上一次性关税退款的增量贡献，同时公司还在加大研发和销售市场投入。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>对<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028</span>财年调整后每股收益的预测从6.40美元下调至6.10美元，降幅<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.7%</span>，</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXVM6o8I14kOhMj1ywwUPESaAnkCfZxIJwicDsMYqCw5D4xBicSeOSKATmITJ7wDy0SU4hXRFC67pG3ANb2DgRFSCpvSHtUdoCEc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 63-JPM-Logitech International-LOGI.US-F1Q27 Review- Delivers on Quarterly Beat but Supply Disruption Tests Near-Term Outlook-260730</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见ΚСⅾеѕk․сοｍ</p>",
